 œuvres auront les Jardins des délices","",[[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4]],[["ٱلَّذِينَ","N","REL|MP",7]],[["ءَامَنُ","V","PERF|VF:4|3MP",18],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["عَمِلُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",41],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["صَّٰلِحَٰتِ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:1|FP|GEN",182]],[["لَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["هُمْ","N","PRON|3MP",-1]],[["جَنَّٰتُ","N","FP|NOM",72]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["نَّعِيمِ","N","M|GEN",562]]]],["pour y demeurer éternellement, - c'est en vérité une promesse d'Allah-. C'est Lui le Puissant, le Sage","",[[["خَٰلِدِينَ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:1|MP|ACC",145]],[["فِي","P","P",3],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]],[["وَعْدَ","N","M|ACC",231]],[["ٱللَّهِ","N","PN|GEN",1]],[["حَقًّا","N","M|INDEF|ACC",47]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["هُوَ","N","PRON|3MS",-1]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["عَزِيزُ","N","MS|NOM",104]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["حَكِيمُ","N","MS|NOM|ADJ",106]]]],["Il a créé les cieux sans piliers que vous puissiez voir; et Il a enfoncé des montagnes fermes dans la terre pour l'empêcher de basculer avec vous; et Il y a propagé des animaux de toute espèce. Et du ciel, Nous avons fait descendre une eau, avec laquelle Nous avons fait pousser des plantes productives par couples de toute espèce","",[[["خَلَقَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",56]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["سَّمَٰوَٰتِ","N","FP|GEN",34]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["غَيْرِ","N","M|GEN",71]],[["عَمَدٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",1950]],[["تَرَ","V","IMPF|VF:1|2MP|MOOD:IND",43],["وْنَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["أَلْقَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:4|3MS",159]],[["فِى","P","P",3]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["أَرْضِ","N","F|GEN",21]],[["رَوَٰسِىَ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:1|FP|ACC",848]],[["أَن","P","SUB",17]],[["تَمِيدَ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3FS|MOOD:SUBJ",1965]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["كُمْ","N","PRON|2MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM: